  "description": "Go Young-Do, a middle-aged man who has spent his life at the bottom of society, ignored by everyone, records a video of himself in a private moment while drunk. When the video is accidentally streamed live, his miserable, overlooked daily life suddenly attracts unexpected attention. What seemed like a form of comfort soon begins to steer Go Young-Do’s life in an unexpected direction.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
